{
  "markdown": "[SOCIAL SECURITY ADMINISTRATION SEAL]\nSocial Security Administration\n**Benefit Verification Letter**\n\n\nDate: April 16, 2026\nBNC#: 98AW400G04124\nREF: A\n\nJANE SAMPLE\n100 MAIN ST\n101\nANYTOWN PR 00999\n\n\nYou asked us for information from your record. The information that you requested\nis shown below. If you want anyone else to have this information, you may send\nthem this letter.\n\n\n**Information About Current Social Security Benefits**\nBeginning December 2025, the full monthly Social Security benefit before any\ndeductions is $1,137.30.\n\n\nWe deduct $81.90 for medical insurance premiums each month.\n\n\nThe regular monthly Social Security payment is $1,055.00.\n(We must round down to the whole dollar.)\n\n\nSocial Security benefits for a given month are paid the following month. (For\nexample, Social Security benefits for March are paid in April.)\n\n\nYour Social Security benefits are paid on or about the fourth Wednesday of each\nmonth.\n\n\nWe found that you became disabled under our rules on December 31, 2021.\n\n\nInformation About Past Social Security Benefits\n\n\nFrom July 2025 to November 2025, the full monthly Social Security benefit before\nany deductions was $1,106.40.\n\n\nWe deducted $65.00 for medical insurance premiums each month.\n\n\nThe regular monthly Social Security payment was $1,041.00.\n(We must round down to the whole dollar.)\n\n\nType of Social Security Benefit Information\nYou are entitled to monthly disability benefits.\n\n\nSee Next Page\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n98AW400G04124\n\n\nPage 2 of 2\n\n\n**Medicare Information**\nYou are entitled to hospital insurance under Medicare beginning August 2025.\n\n\nYou are entitled to medical insurance under Medicare beginning August 2025.\n\n\nYour Medicare number is 1UX3VM6MM52 . You may use this number to get\nmedical services while waiting for your Medicare card.\n\n\nIf you have any questions, please log into Medicare.gov, or call 1-800-MEDICARE\n(1-800-633-4227).\n\n\n**Date of Birth Information**\nThe date of birth shown on our records is November 14, 1981 .\n\n\n**Suspect Social Security Fraud?**\nPlease visit http://oig.ssa.gov/r or call the Inspector General's Fraud Hotline at\n1-800-269-0271 (TTY 1-866-501-2101).\n\n\nIf You Have Questions\n\n\n# Need more help?\n\n\n 1. Visit www.ssa.gov for fast, simple and secure online service.\n 2. Call us at **1-800-772-1213**, weekdays from 8:00 am to 7:00 pm. If you are\ndeaf or hard of hearing, call TTY **1-800-325-0778**. Please mention this letter\nwhen you call.\n 3. You may also call your local office at **1-833-882-1202**.\n\n\nSOCIAL SECURITY\nESCORIAL SHOPPING CT\n5829 AVE 65INF STE 201\nCAROLINA PR 00987\n\n\n*Social Security Administration*\n\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m427v4cc6njszfxjf8zp20kw -->",
